Tic Tac Toe Game
A classic Tic Tac Toe game built with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Bootstrap 5. This project features a responsive and interactive interface for two players.

🚀 Features
Clean and Responsive UI: Built with Bootstrap 5 for a modern, mobile-friendly layout.

Two-Player Mode: Play against a friend on the same device.

Win/Tie Detection: The game automatically detects wins and ties.

Game Reset: A restart button allows you to quickly start a new game.

Turn Indicator: Displays which player's turn is next.

🛠️ Technologies Used
HTML5: Structures the game board and elements.

CSS3: Provides custom styling and hover effects.

JavaScript: Handles all game logic, including moves, win conditions, and turn management.

Bootstrap 5: Used for responsive grid layout and component styling.

📁 Project Structure
text
tic-tac-toe/
├── index.html          # Main HTML file
├── style.css           # Custom styles
├── script.js           # Game logic
└── README.md           # Project documentation
📋 Game Logic Overview
The JavaScript code manages the game state with the following key components:

Current Player Tracking: Switches between 'X' and 'O'.

Win Condition Check: Tests all 8 possible winning combinations after each move.

Draw Condition Check: Declares a tie if all squares are filled without a winner.

🎮 How to Play
Open index.html in your web browser.

Players take turns clicking on an empty square.

Player 1 is X, and Player 2 is O.

The first player to get three of their marks in a row (horizontally, vertically, or diagonally) wins.

If all squares are filled with no winner, the game is a draw.

Press the "Restart" button to reset the game at any time.
